{"seq":3,"slug":"self-cultivation","title":"Self Cultivation","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/self-cultivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unity-of-knowledge-action","title":"知行本体","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/self-cultivation/unity-of-knowledge-action","wordCount":1790,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"everyday-practice","title":"事上磨练","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/self-cultivation/everyday-practice","wordCount":1782,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现王阳明的修养工夫论。&quot;知行本体&quot;揭示了知行本然一体——&quot;一念发动处便即是行了&quot;，真知必能行，道德的工夫要在念头发动的最幽微处用功。&quot;事上磨练&quot;则主张，德性的涵养必须在处理日常事务、应对人伦世事的实践中进行——工夫不离事、动静合一、日用伦常即道场。本章揭示王阳明心学注重实践、经世致用的修养智慧。</p>\n"}